(defrule tool-surface -> :instruction "道具の仕組みが両立させる性質を 1 文で書く" :sample "The tools through which the agent interacts with the development environment form an extensible ecosystem that balances comprehensive capability with context efficiency, safety with flexibility, and built-in tools with dynamic discovery.")
(defrule tool-registry -> :instruction "呼び出しを取り扱い部品へ配る部品と、道具の定義を集める部品を 1〜2 文で書く" :sample "ToolRegistry serves as the central dispatcher, mapping tool names to handler methods across 12 handler classes organized by category (file, process, web, notebook, user interaction, task management, thinking, MCP discovery, batch execution; see Table 1 in Appendix A for the complete mapping).")
