(defrule hook-what -> :instruction "外部の手続きをループの途中に差し込む仕組みが何で、どんな時点で呼ばれるかを 1 文で書く" :sample "Hooks are callbacks that fire at specific points in the loop: before a tool runs, after it returns, when the agent finishes, and so on.")
