(defrule hook-isolation -> :instruction "フックがどこで動き、文脈に何の影響があるかを 1 文で書く" :sample "Hooks run in your application process, not inside the agent's context window, so they don't consume context.")
(defrule hook-blocking -> :instruction "呼び出しを止めたり引数を書き換えたりできる時点と、止めない時点の違いを書く。違いが無ければ書かない" :sample "Blocking events (PreToolUse, UserPromptSubmit, SubagentStart) can prevent the operation (exit code 2 returns a block reason to the agent), mutate tool arguments (stdout JSON with tool_input key), or override approval decisions.")
(defrule hook-merging -> :instruction "全体の設定と案件の設定のフックをどう合わせるかを 1 文で書く。合わせる仕組みが無ければ書かない" :sample "Global and project hooks merge by appending project matchers after global matchers per event type, enabling organization-wide policies combined with repository-specific hooks (e.g., “run eslint after file edits”).")
(defrule hooks-part -> :nucleus hook-what :elaboration-set-member hook-points :elaboration-object-attribute hook-isolation :elaboration-additional hook-blocking :elaboration-additional hook-merging)
(defrule planner-stages -> :instruction "計画を別に立てるなら、その段階の数と内容を順に書く。計画の段階が無ければ書かない" :sample "The Planner subagent executes in three stages visible in Figure 5.")
(defrule plan-review -> :instruction "計画を書き終えた後、何を誰に返し、利用者がどう選ぶかを 1 文で書く" :sample "Upon completion, the Planner returns the plan file path to the main agent.")
