(defrule plan-then-act -> :nucleus planner-stages :elaboration-process-step plan-review :elaboration-additional replanning)
(defrule slash-commands -> :instruction "モデルを通さずに利用者の入力を処理する経路があるかを 1 文で書く" :sample "The system therefore implements a dual-path dispatch at the input boundary: if the input begins with a “ / ” prefix, it is routed to a registered command handler; otherwise, it proceeds to the query processor and enters the agent loop.")
(defrule mechanisms -> :instruction "全段階にまたがる仕組みを、1 行に 1 つ仕組みの名前で挙げる。中断、実行中に届くメッセージの待ち行列、費用の記録のうち、このハーネスにあるもの" :frame "explain-agent-harness.mechanism.lisp")
(defrule usage-accounting -> :instruction "費用や使用量を、いつ、どこに記録し、どう表示するかを書く。記録しないなら書かない" :sample "Session cost tracking records cumulative token usage and cost after each LLM call via a CostTracker service that computes cost from the API’s reported token counts and the model’s pricing metadata; running totals are displayed in the TUI status bar and persisted in session metadata for resumption across --continue invocations.")
