(defrule control-decisions -> :instruction "許可と制御で下した設計の決定を、1 行に 1 つ決定の名前で挙げる。承認の門、消せない規則、規則の保存、フック、安全の構えのうち、このハーネスにあるもの" :frame "explain-agent-harness.decision.lisp")
(defrule control-part -> :nucleus approval-part :elaboration-additional call-policies-part :elaboration-part-whole hooks-part :elaboration-part-whole plan-then-act :elaboration-additional slash-commands :elaboration-part-whole mechanisms :elaboration-additional usage-part :elaboration-additional control-decisions)
