(defrule delegation-decisions -> :instruction "部下の扱いで下した設計の決定を、1 行に 1 つ決定の名前で挙げる。道具の制限、並べた実行、指示に入れる終了の条件のうち、このハーネスにあるもの" :frame "explain-agent-harness.decision.lisp")
(defrule delegation-part -> :nucleus subagent-what :elaboration-object-attribute subagent-isolation :elaboration-set-member subagent-roles :elaboration-additional delegation-decisions)
(defrule session-identity -> :instruction "実行にどんな識別子が付き、後で再開するために何を控えるかを 1〜2 文で書く" :sample "Each interaction with the SDK creates or continues a session. Capture the session ID from ResultMessage.session_id (available in both SDKs) to resume later.")
(defrule session-resume -> :instruction "再開すると何が元に戻るかを 1 文で書く" :sample "When you resume, the full context from previous turns is restored: files that were read, analysis that was performed, and actions that were taken.")
(defrule session-fork -> :instruction "元を変えずに別の方法を試す手段があれば書く。無ければ書かない" :sample "You can also fork a session to branch into a different approach without modifying the original.")
(defrule transcript-store -> :instruction "会話の記録をどこにどんな形で保存するか、別の置き場へ写せるかを 1 文で書く" :sample "To resume sessions across stateless containers or serverless hosts, pass a session_store / sessionStore adapter so the SDK mirrors transcripts to your own backend and another host can resume.")
(defrule undo-record -> :instruction "ファイル操作の記録が持つ項目と、記録を置く場所を書く。記録しないなら書かない" :sample "Each operation record contains the operation type, file path, timestamp, a unique identifier, and the file’s content before the operation.")
(defrule undo-flow -> :instruction "取り消しを求められたときの手順を 1 文で書く" :sample "When the user invokes undo, the system pops the most recent operation from the in-memory list and reverses it: created files are deleted, modified files are reverted to their backed-up content, and deleted files are restored from the saved copy.")
